# Per-test plusargs for move_a7_a7_with_irq.
#
# Inject level-1 IRQ at the MOVE.L (A7),A7 commit window.  The exact
# cycle depends on front-end + LSU latency; pick a value tuned to land
# in the post-MOVE.L-commit / pre-RTS-AGU window.  Sweep range during
# tuning: cycles 80..200 typically cover that boundary at default
# pipeline params.
+ipl=120:1
